---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Terms & Conditions | Real BMI"
    description="Review the official terms and conditions for using Real BMI, our free browser-based health calculators, educational reference tools, and wellness resources."
    canonicalURL="https://realbmicalculator.com/en/terms-conditions/"
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
        title="Terms & Conditions"
        eyebrow="Professional standards"
        description="Review the terms of use for Real BMI’s calculators, health tools, and privacy-forward experience."
        returnUrl="/en/"
        returnLabel="Home"
    >
        <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed space-y-8 text-base sm:text-lg font-medium opacity-90">
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal text-[var(--foreground)] leading-relaxed">
                These Terms and Conditions govern your access to and use of <strong class="text-[var(--foreground)]">Real BMI</strong>, including all interactive calculators, health reference charts, educational guides, and software utilities.
            </p>
            <p>
                By accessing or using our platform, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree with any part of these provisions, you should discontinue using the site.
            </p>

            <!-- 1. Educational Scope & Non-Diagnostic Purpose -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    1. Educational Scope & Non-Diagnostic Purpose
                </h2>
                <p>
                    All calculators, assessment scores, and health reference models provided on Real BMI are designed strictly for general educational and personal health awareness.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Under no circumstances should calculations or metrics generated by this service be interpreted as medical diagnoses, individualized clinical assessments, or treatment prescriptions.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Always seek the advice of a qualified healthcare professional regarding any medical condition, physical training, or dietary lifestyle change.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. Scientific Formulas & Calculation Accuracy -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    2. Scientific Formulas & Calculation Accuracy
                </h2>
                <p>
                    Real BMI implements scientifically recognized, peer-reviewed mathematical formulas, such as standards published by the World Health Organization (WHO) and Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC).
                </p>
                <p>
                    While our algorithms accurately reflect published literature, individual human biology varies significantly due to muscle mass, bone density, age, and genetics.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Consequently, statistical population models may not perfectly match an individual's true metabolic or cardiometabolic state.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. Local Browser Processing & Data Privacy -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    3. Local Browser Processing & Data Privacy
                </h2>
                <p>
                    We prioritize user privacy by design. All anthropometric parameters (such as height, weight, age, and waist) are computed entirely client-side within your local browser.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Real BMI never transmits, stores, sells, or logs your personal health calculations to external databases or remote servers.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- 4. Permitted Use & User Obligations -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    4. Permitted Use & User Obligations
                </h2>
                <p>
                    You are granted a revocable, non-exclusive license to access Real BMI for personal, non-commercial educational use.
                </p>
                <p>
                    You agree not to engage in automated scraping, denial-of-service attacks, reverse engineering, or unauthorized distribution of our site assets without prior written consent.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. Intellectual Property Rights -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    5. Intellectual Property Rights
                </h2>
                <p>
                    All proprietary software code, visual layouts, design typography, custom 3D WebGL meshes, and editorial analysis published on Real BMI are protected by copyright and intellectual property treaties.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Reproduction, republication, or commercial exploitation without express written permission is strictly prohibited.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- 6. Limitation of Liability -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    6. Limitation of Liability
                </h2>
                <p>
                    Real BMI and its creators provide this platform on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied.
                </p>
                <p>
                    In no event shall Real BMI, its contributors, or technical operators be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use of our tools, or from decisions made based on informational estimates.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- 7. Updates to Terms -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    7. Updates to Terms
                </h2>
                <p>
                    We reserve the right to revise or update these Terms and Conditions at any time to reflect platform improvements, operational changes, or legal requirements.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Continued use of Real BMI following published revisions constitutes your binding acceptance of the updated terms.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- 8. Content Quality & Privacy Protection Protocol -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    8. Content Quality & Privacy Protection Protocol
                </h2>
                <p>
                    All computational calculators, articles, and reference datasets published on Real BMI undergo a mandatory pre-publication content review and privacy screening audit.
                </p>
                <p>
                    We strictly prohibit the public exposure of personal identifying information. We do not operate public message boards, user profile registries, or exposed contact directories.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Any feedback or inquiries submitted through our encrypted contact channels are handled confidentially and are never published online.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
